Third-party assets
==================

The vendor skin PNGs and the English/Simplified Chinese text XML files under
assets/gui come from the official Redragon K617 RGB 1.6.6 installer. They are
included so the Linux GUI can reproduce the vendor layout for interoperability
with hardware the user owns. They remain the property of their respective
owner and are not covered by the MIT license that applies to this project's
source code.

The bundled DejaVu Sans font is covered by assets/gui/DejaVu-LICENSE.txt.
